# PROD: copy to ~/prod/events/.env.local, chmod 600; fill privately.
# Use docs/ENVIRONMENTS.md for values. No secrets or values in this template.
# prod-events listens on 7006, kernel host jin.imajin.ai, mount /events.
# Required build values: /events basePath; imajin.ai domain; service prefix unset.
# Required runtime: IMAJIN_ENV unset, APP_DB_SCHEMA events, distinct prod identity.
